      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MESSI TARO (1) missed the frame latest (20.43) when seventh over 340m at Gunnedah in a Mix 2/3. Rates on top and should go close. HAYMAN BEACH (2) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 2nd at this track over 318m. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Winning chance. GO FORWARD BLOCK (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (19.86) at Gunnedah behind Little Miss Ando in a Mix 1/2/3. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Must be included in calculations. CHARGE THE CARD (7) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 5 at Gunnedah over 340m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck.",
